ghost: ...Enough. That's enough.
ghost: The oath hasn't broken you yet. Good — that was the only thing I needed to see.
ghost: Go on, then. There's a cave past Town's edge that answers to the same kind of strain as your Core. The rest of this waits there, not here.
ghost: I'll go back to sleep now. Try not to make me get up again.
[end_timeline]
